     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "f8bbef90-169d-2e45-a9f7-c4333f70d84f"],
     "FiltKernel is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "af866ea9-6e5d-a14d-9ed5-58773bec22a8"],
     ", Smooth",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "78c8532e-b64f-114f-9b5b-80cfcfbd9d9c"],
     " and SmoothSegmentation. How much the contours are smoothed."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5c6757fa-d0d7-4344-97bb-a86f2bcb1967"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "87e3953e-902b-3b46-88be-26a5ca0c5f4b"], 
    ButtonBox["MaskDilation",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsMaskingTools/ref/MaskDilation"], "0", Cell[
    TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "fc56b303-7f34-5340-af3c-13ad30e27ded"],
     "Dilation is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "40d3912f-38b8-ec41-aa03-eace42de6c9e"],
     ", Smooth",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "Mask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "38549079-3e01-2643-9fc2-0b20cd10916f"],
     " and SmoothSegmentation. If the value is greater than 0 it will dilate \
